# apps/api reads its configuration from the monorepo root .env (see ../../.env.example
# for the full variable list and descriptions — DATABASE_URL, REDIS_URL, JWT_*,
# AI_ENGINE_URL, INTERNAL_SERVICE_TOKEN, CORS_ORIGIN, ADMIN_EMAIL/PASSWORD,
# BMKG_POLL_INTERVAL_MS, RISK_NOTIFICATION_THRESHOLD, etc).
#
# For local (non-docker-compose) development, copy the relevant keys from
# ../../.env.example into a apps/api/.env file — env.validation.ts (src/config)
# will fail fast at boot if any required variable is missing.
